# Fishers iOS UI

When editing SwiftUI under `ios/`, follow the project skill
`.cursor/skills/apple-hig-designer/SKILL.md`.

Priorities for this app:
- Clarity, deference, depth — content over chrome
- Semantic colors + `AccentColor` (pitch green); support light and dark
- Dynamic Type text styles (`.title`, `.body`, …), not fixed point sizes for reading UI
- `NavigationStack` + large titles on top-level tabs; inset grouped lists
- 3–5 tab bar items; SF Symbols; 44pt minimum hit targets
- Destructive actions use confirmation dialogs
- Keep the Fishers logo for auth / empty brand moments — not a permanent top chrome bar
